@host = https://localhost:7219
@actorToken = replace-with-validated-entra-user-token
@subjectOid = 9155ff4d-2708-4770-b87e-e238645ec5df
@unitOrganizationId = aaaaaaaa-aaaa-aaaa-aaaa-aaaaaaaaaaaa

### Liveness
GET {{host}}/health

### Database readiness
GET {{host}}/ready

### Protected decision. The bearer token oid must match subjectId.
POST {{host}}/v1/decisions
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{actorToken}}

{
  "subjectId": "{{subjectOid}}",
  "tenantId": "default",
  "unitOrganizationId": "{{unitOrganizationId}}",
  "httpMethod": "GET",
  "routeTemplate": "/customers/{id}",
  "roleIds": []
}

### Exact endpoint policy. Administrator duty is checked using the bearer token.
GET {{host}}/v1/policies?tenantId=default&unitOrganizationId={{unitOrganizationId}}&httpMethod=GET&routeTemplate=%2Fcustomers%2F%7Bid%7D
Authorization: Bearer {{actorToken}}
